{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honu</strong> is a first-person 3D puzzle adventure set in a world where magic and technology come together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As an explorer stepping through a portal, you find yourself on the untouched island of <strong>Honu</strong>, a place where nature has reclaimed the ruins of an ancient civilization. Strange <strong>magitech</strong> devices lie dormant among moss-covered stones, waiting to be understood once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a variety of biomes, from lush forests to ancient ruins. Unravel the island\u2019s secrets by solving\u00a0<strong>magitech puzzles</strong> that challenge your logic and creativity. Piece by piece, you\u2019ll uncover the story of the people who once blended magic and technology to shape their world, and learn why they vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Honu</i> offers a story-driven experience full of mystery, exploration, and wonder, inviting you to think, experiment, and shape the world with the power of magitech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.poster.avif?t=1763166989\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.webm?t=1763166989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.mp4?t=1763166989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful puzzles</strong> \u2013 Repair, activate, and understand ancient magitech left behind by a lost civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world</strong> \u2013 Explore a vibrant island filled with ruins, puzzles, and traces of old magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful encounters</strong> \u2013 Engage in quiet, heartfelt dialogue with the island\u2019s inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey of discovery</strong> \u2013 Follow your curiosity through a story about wonder, memory, and renewal.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Slight Tingle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/bda054cb44a674b708e275665e7288a9a034f771.jpg"},{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/28acb577b2d819d5ef80e69f4f8b60bbf46c361c.jpg"},{"name":"Bulldozer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/bb77fced24a285336eb7e6425abb7b3c1ac41c75.jpg"},{"name":"Captain on the Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/579ae263fce27511917b528c1e91940b4f5ab4e1.jpg"},{"name":"Cat in the Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/34cf8d5ef745cfebe68585595aa464145805e486.jpg"},{"name":"Research Assistant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/2f0909f1c6762001d8e8e9b9cff41e70109cb809.jpg"},{"name":"Desert Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/574682eef31daccf717646b8219ce32900b0487a.jpg"},{"name":"UPGRADE!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/2e4fa17a12c7b74943f6bf4db5a9e2f9e4d73498.jpg"},{"name":"What Once Was Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3318830/1726d06539d80b97ed83fefd02d05caa0381e996.jpg"},{"name":"Cracked the Nut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic